==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Grimer}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Alolan Grimer|130}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*{{m|Pound}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Grimer can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

